`,r.jsx(i.p,{children:"As you can see, I was struggling with the layout, especially with the text overflowing the width of the thumbnail and wrapping. I later discovered this issue happened when the preview of the composable did not have a fixed size."}),`
`,r.jsx(i.p,{children:"After we got access to the drawables folder, I imported some assets, like the thumbnail background and icons for the calendar and gauge, and implemented them to the card. I also added the class duration in the thumbnail, and now the card is a lot more like the intended design:"}),`
